00:33:25.930 --> 00:33:26.930
I like the theory.
我喜欢这个理论。

00:33:26.930 --> 00:33:28.690
I don't know how conscious it was.
我不知道它的意识如何。

00:33:28.690 --> 00:33:34.769
Emerged more subconsciously than as something planned, but I think there is very much something to the theory.
比计划中的事情更多是在潜意识中出现的，但我认为这个理论有很多东西。

00:33:34.769 --> 00:33:37.170
I am guilty.
我有罪。

00:33:37.170 --> 00:33:39.049
Please equip me.
请装备我。

00:33:39.049 --> 00:33:41.410
All sins off again.
一切罪孽再次消散。

00:33:41.410 --> 00:33:43.809
New York City.
纽约市。

